  "_maintained_by": "Hand-authored. The Go (bindings/go/rules.go) and TypeScript (bindings/typescript/validate.ts) implementations both read this file, so every vector here must hold in both. `executor` is the PaymentRequest member verbatim, omitted when null. `wantAsset` is the asset_identifier the refusal must name, and is empty when `wantErr` is false.",
  "_rule": "An originator-fulfilled payment is delivered with an EIP-3009 transferWithAuthorization signed on the destination token, so every destination must appear in eip3009-tokens.json. Settler fulfill is unchecked (CORE-2776).",
